+The first office-smoke gate cleared at 15:43:21.890 UTC, but the game process was created at 15:44:17.431 after protected-file verification and monitor setup. Its first acting reading was already below the 8 GiB start line; free commit later reached 1.05 GiB and the 4 GiB guard stopped the owned monitor first, then the game, before Runtime.log or capture frames existed. This is a controlled stop, not a runtime crash. The delayed admission is established; the source of the later memory spike is not established by these receipts.
